hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"229","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin Mani', qala: Haddasana Mu'awiyah bin 'Amr, qala: Haddasana Za'idah, 'an Bayan, 'an Qais bin Abi Hazim, 'an Jarir bin 'Abdillah, qala: Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne mujhe mere Islam laane ke baad se kabhi hijab nahi kiya, aur na hi mujhe dekhe bagair hanse."
"230","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin Mani', qala: Haddasana Mu'awiyah bin 'Amr, qala: Haddasana Za'idah, 'an Isma'il bin Abi Khalid, 'an Qais, 'an Jarir, qala: Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ne mujhe kabhi hijab nahi kiya, aur mere Islam laane ke baad se na mujhe dekhe magar muskuraaye."
"231","[AI-translation] Haddasana Hannad bin As-Sari, qala: Haddasana Abu Mu'awiyah, 'an Al-A'mash, 'an Ibrahim, 'an 'Abidah As-Salmani, 'an 'Abdullah bin Mas'ud, qala: Qala Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam: Main jahannam walo mein se aakhir nikalne wale ko pehchannta hoon, ek aadmi jahannam se rengta hua niklega, us se kaha jayega: Chal jannat mein daakhil ho. Woh jannat mein daakhil hone ke liye jayega, toh paayega ke log makaan le chuke hain, woh wapas aayega aur kahega: Ya Rabbi! Log makaan le chuke hain. Us se kaha jayega: Kya tum woh waqt yaad karte ho jis mein tum the? Woh kahega: Haan. Us se kaha jayega: Tamanna karo. Woh tamanna karega. Us se kaha jayega: Tumhein woh mila jis ki tum ne tamanna ki, aur duniya ke das guna. Woh kahega: Kya aap mera mazaaq uda rahe hain, jab ke aap Malik hain? 'Abdullah bin Mas'ud farmate hain: Maine Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ko hansta hua dekha, yahan tak ke un ke daant zahir ho gaye."
"232","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaibah bin Sa'id, qala: Haddasana Abu Al-Ahwas, 'an Abu Ishaq, 'an 'Ali bin Rabi'ah, qala: Main Hazrat Ali ke paas haazir hua, un ke paas ek sawaari laai gayi taake woh is par sawaar hon. Jab unhone apna paan rakaab mein rakha toh farmaya: Bismillah. Jab us ki peeth par sawaar hua toh farmaya: Alhamdulillah. Phir farmaya: Subhan-allazi sakhkhara lana hadha wa ma kunna lahu muqrineen wa inna ila Rabbina la munqaliboon. Phir farmaya: Alhamdulillah teen baar, Allahu Akbar teen baar, Subhanaka inni zalamtu nafsi faghfir li fa innahu la yaghfir adh-dhunuba illa ant. Phir unhone hansi, maine poocha: Kis cheez se aap hanse, Ya Amir-ul-Mu'mineen? Farmaya: Maine Rasulullah sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ko waisa hi karte hue dekha jaisa maine kiya, phir unhone hansi. Maine poocha: Kis cheez se aap hanse, Ya Rasulallah? Farmaya: Tera Rab apne bandey se ta'ajjub karta hai jab woh kahta hai: Rabbi ighfir li dhunubi, innahu la yaghfir adh-dhunuba ghairuk."
"233","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Bashshar, qala: Haddasana Muhammad bin 'Abdullah Al-Ansari, qala: Haddasana 'Abdullah bin 'Awn, 'an Muhammad bin Muhammad bin Al-Aswad, 'an 'Amir bin Sa'd, qala: Sa'd ne kaha: Maine Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam ko Khandaq ke din hansta hua dekha yahan tak ke un ke daant zahir ho gaye. Kaha: Maine poocha: Kaise hua? Kaha: Ek aadmi tha jis ke paas dhaal thee, aur Sa'd teer andaz the, aur woh aise aise dhaal se apni peshani chupaata tha, Sa'd ne us ke liye ek teer nikaala, jab us ne apna sar uthaya toh us pe maara aur ye peshani ghala nahi, aur woh aadmi ulat gaya aur apna paan utha liya. Toh Nabi sallallahu 'alayhi wa sallam hanse yahan tak ke un ke daant zahir ho gaye. Kaha: Maine poocha: Kis cheez se hanse? Kaha: Us aadmi par us ke kiye se."
"234","[AI-translation] Ham se hadith bayan ki Mahmud bin Ghailan ne, kaha: Ham se hadith bayan ki Abu Usamah ne, Sharik se, Asim Ahwal se, Anas bin Malik se, kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Aey do kaanon wale!"
